      {
        "text": "Nolan Southerland is a film editor and member of IATSE Local 700. Southerland supports rent stabilization and stronger tenant protections, including limiting annual rent increases to 3% or 60% of the Consumer Price Index, whichever is lower. He supports creating a Tenant Opportunity to Purchase Act, banning certain evictions, and dedicating city staff to enforce housing laws. He also proposes expanding public housing and requiring community benefit agreements from private developers.",
